      "lines": [
        "18 components of @nextcloud/vue are delivered although no file in src names them, no other dependency names them and no component named by either imports them: 14,736 B, 1.3 % of the static path of checksum-main.mjs, next to 1 component the source names and 1 those pull in.",
        "  NcRichText 5,027 B, NcPopover 4,296 B, NcActionButton 3,143 B, NcIconSvgWrapper 1,009 B, NcEmojiPicker 559 B, NcProgressBar 300 B, and 12 more.",
        "These arrive through the root import: under a barrel the whole component set is reachable, so the bundler must keep it. Per-component imports leave it free to drop what the app never names."
